  "A-CityGetBuildQueueFinishProgress": {
   "id": "A-CityGetBuildQueueFinishProgress",
   "displayName": "City:GetBuildQueue():FinishProgress()",
   "availability": "GamePlay",
   "invoke": "Colon (Instance)",
   "table": "City",
   "path": [
    "GetBuildQueue",
    "FinishProgress",
    null
   ],
   "notes": [
    "[作用] 试图完成城市当前正在建造的项目",
    "[注意] FinishProgress 有时无法真正完成生产。如果生产项有减产效果，FinishProgress 只会推进生产项的部分生产进度。例如，如果生产开拓者时 -50% 生产力，且开拓者剩余成本是 100，FinishProgress 最终只会增加 50 点生产进度，不会完成生产。详情可查看 AddProgress 函数"
   ],
   "enrichUnused": null,
   "usageSummary": null
  },
